# Deterministic two-player exercise. The loop is compact but expands beyond
# 10,000 frames in the cabinet scheduler.
120
2 coin
20
2 2coin
20
2 1p 2p
120
loop
24 right b1 2left 2b2
3 right b1 b2 2left 2b1
24 left b2 2right 2b1
3 left b1 b2 2right 2b1 2b2
18 up right b1 2down 2left 2b2
18 down left b2 2up 2right 2b1
10
repeat 130
